              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo ndibabingira omuri egi nsi, mukaza omu nsi ei mutaamanyaga n'obu baakuba baashwenkuriimwe, kandi okwo niyo muriheererereza baaruhanga abandi nyomushana na nyekiro; ahabw'okuba tindibagirira mbabazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
